      "width": 993.3000000000001,
      "height": 105.0,
      "text": "grey nodes are PassThroughNode stubs waiting on a later phase\nred nodes end the turn without an answer from the model\ndashed arrows are the same thing seen closer up, not a step\n\nselect_sop scores every procedure once and both routing nodes read that one Ranking: within 0.08 of each other and it asks which,\nand a procedure already under way is only abandoned for one 0.15 clear of it.",
